
  ---------------------------------------------------------
  AEGIS  /  GEOSPATIAL VIEW
  Local application control center
  ---------------------------------------------------------

  APPLICATION
   1. Launch application             Start local services

  SETUP & VALIDATION
   2. Install / update dependencies  Sync and build
   3. Rebuild frontend               Run frontend production build
   4. Initialize database            Create, upgrade, and seed SQLite schema
   5. Run test suite                 Validate installation

  SOURCE CONTROL
   6. Check for updates              Report main branch status only
   7. Update application             Pull the latest main branch

  DATA & MAINTENANCE
   8. Remove logs                    Clear application logs
   9. Clear cache                    Remove runtime and test caches
  10. Remove all data                Delete user-generated data
  11. Uninstall application          Remove local dependencies

  EXIT
  12. Exit                           Close launcher
  ---------------------------------------------------------

PASS: explicit AEGIS_DATA_DIR process override survives Import-EnvironmentFile.
